---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Mark from '../components/Mark.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact | COM<tech> Consulting"
  description="Contact Anders Hybertz at COM<tech> Consulting in Copenhagen. Direct contact by email or LinkedIn: no account managers, no intake steps."
>
  <div slot="opening" class="intro">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-title">Get in touch</h1>
      <p class="lead">Write to me directly. A short description of the system and the decision in front of you is enough to start.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section contact" aria-labelledby="h-mail">
    <div class="watermark" aria-hidden="true"><Mark /></div>
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="h-mail" class="sr-only">Email and LinkedIn</h2>
      <a class="mail" href="mailto:anders@comtechconsulting.dk?subject=Enquiry%20via%20comtechconsulting.dk">anders@comtechconsulting.dk</a>
      <p class="body">If you have a technical challenge, an architectural decision to make, or need an outside perspective, the conversation starts directly with me. No account managers, no intake steps.</p>
      <div class="actions links">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:anders@comtechconsulting.dk?subject=Enquiry%20via%20comtechconsulting.dk">Write an email</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andershybertz/">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-white" aria-labelledby="h-start">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><h2 id="h-start" class="h2">How it starts</h2></div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><h3>You write with the context you have</h3><p>A short description is enough. It does not have to be fully structured before the first conversation.</p></li>
        <li><h3>We talk through the problem</h3><p>The point is to understand the situation and whether there is a sensible fit. Not to turn the call into a sales exercise.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Then we decide whether to proceed</h3><p>If there is a good match, we define the next step in a practical way. If not, the conversation should still have been useful.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="where">Based in Copenhagen, working with clients across Denmark and internationally. COM&lt;tech&gt; Consulting, <a href="https://datacvr.virk.dk/enhed/virksomhed/25567471" rel="noopener">CVR 25567471</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contact { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .contact .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .watermark { position: absolute; right: -4vw; top: 50%; width: min(52vw, 760px); transform: translateY(-50%); color: #e3e7eb; pointer-events: none; }
  .watermark :global(.mark) { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .watermark :global(.mark-sq) { fill: #dcdffa; }
  .mail {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--signal);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.4vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--ink);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .mail:hover { color: var(--signal); }
  .links { margin-top: 28px; }
  .where { margin-top: 56px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-3); }
</style>
